；整体包装风格明亮多彩、现代俏皮，版式清晰，像真实包装设计图一样平铺展开。\n\n右侧画面：展示真实广告摄影效果图，猫粮盒竖立在现代大理石台面上，盒子正面清晰可见，旁边是一只黄色树脂盘子，里面盛满松脆的猫粮颗粒，点缀几块新鲜三文鱼和猫薄荷叶；白色猫咪吉祥物从盒子后探出头来，用前爪端着一只小碗猫粮；温暖柔和的灯光，现代厨房模糊背景，窗外透进阳光；画面超细致，逼真的食物纹理，摄影风格，4k。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 107, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [160], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [179], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [270, 126], "pos": [411.9134521484375, 163.67005920410156], "widgets_values": ["Qwen-Image-Lightning-8steps-V1.1-bf16.safetensors", 1, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 162, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 163, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIPCLIP"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_clip"}, "name": "strength_clip", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "CLIP强度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 97, "type": "LoraLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoader"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [180, 181, 182], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [750.9932861328125, 130.74948120117188], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 179, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 178, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 108, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name fo